Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi, you would have to use a custom function which, for each permutation, generates N random graphs and calculates small-worldness or rich-club coefficients for each random graph. This would be very computationally intensive. See the discussion at https://groups.google.com/g/braingraph-help/c/kDz0KW3t6WU/m/JRpazCwnBAAJ for some details.

